  "title": "Apple Topaz Candies",
  "description": "An apple goes a long way in this candy recipe! Little apple bits are rolled in cinnamon and sugar, caramel, and chopped nuts. Although they do take some work, they're well worth it. They're just perfect for harvest parties in the fall!",
